{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24626","headline":"岁暮夜长病中灯下闻卢尹夜宴以诗戏之且爲来日张本也 · 白居易","name":"岁暮夜长病中灯下闻卢尹夜宴以诗戏之且爲来日张本也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荣闹兴多嫌昼短，衰闲睡少觉明迟。\n当君秉烛衔杯夜，是我停飱服药时。\n枕上愁吟堪发病，府中欢笑胜寻医。\n明朝强出须谋乐，不拟车公更拟谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}